    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried some of those statistical methods, but it still feels like there's something \"invisible\" happening with these specific shipments. like, the data says everything is fine, but then a container just disappears for two weeks for absolutely no reason. it's almost like there are hidden factors or little disruptions happening behind the scenes that our current tracking doesn't catch. is there any way to model for those types of \"unseen\" or unpredictable interruptions specifically?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
